长衣","en":"Shu Brocade Coat"},"level":"2","description":{"zh":"选用了益州特有的面料并进行了纹饰处理的长袍，衣服的边缘处也添加了简单的纹饰。","en":"A long robe made from fabric unique to Yi Province and adorned with patterns, with simple motifs also added along the edges."},"defenceVal":"3","hp":"550","mp":"550","price":"7200","slot":{"zh":"护甲","en":"Armor"}},{"id":"WP1027205","name":{"zh":"锦绣金顶冠","en":"Golden Brocade Crown"},"level":"3","description":{"zh":"采用金丝玉缕制成的小冠，并配有独特的玉饰，由此可见此冠来历非同一般。","en":"A small crown of gold thread and jade, fitted with unique jade ornaments, clearly of distinguished origin."},"mp":"1800","evade":"10","price":"15000","slot":{"zh":"头盔","en":"Helmet"}}],"family":{"father":{"label":{"zh":"父亲","en":"Father"},"people":[{"id":"WJ10128","code":"0"}]},"family":{"label":{"zh":"亲属","en":"Relatives"},"people":[{"id":"WJ10795","code":"100"}]}},"clans":[{"id":"GI102615","name":{"zh":"涿郡刘氏","en":"The Liu clan of Zhuo Commandery"},"years":["184","264"],"desc":{"zh":"帝尧之后，出自姬姓，汉景帝子中山靖王刘胜之后，涿郡宗室支脉。蜀汉皇族。刘备以汉室宗亲起于微末，三顾茅庐，夺荆入川，建立蜀汉，与魏吴鼎足而立，享国四十三载。","en":"Descended from Emperor Yao and originating from the Ji surname, they were a branch of the imperial clan in Zhuo Commandery tracing their lineage to Liu Sheng, Prince Jing of Zhongshan and son of Emperor Jing of Han. As the imperial house of Shu-Han, Liu Bei rose from humble origins as a scion of the Han dynasty. After making three visits to the thatched cottage, taking Jing Province, and entering Yi Province, he founded Shu-Han to stand in a tripartite balance with Wei and Wu, ruling for forty-three years."},"talent":{"military":"7","commerce":"4","politics":"8"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":null,"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[52,