e":"0","role":0,"stats":[52,60,74,63,81,96],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10017","armor":"WP1017005","helmet":"WP1027205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[52,60,74,63,81,96],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10017","armor":"WP1017005","helmet":"WP1027205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[52,60,74,63,81,96],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10017","armor":"WP1017005","helmet":"WP1027205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10128","city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[52,60,74,63,81,96],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"13920","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10017","armor":"WP1017005","helmet":"WP1027205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[52,60,74,63,81,96],"title":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"100","reputation":"15000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10017","armor":"WP1017005","helmet":"WP1027205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10128","city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[52,60,74,63,81,96],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10017","armor":"WP1017005","helmet":"WP1027205"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"蜀汉后主刘禅第五子，昭烈帝刘备之孙。自幼聪明，英敏过人。景耀二年，被封为北地王。炎兴元年，魏将邓艾攻破绵竹关时，后主刘禅在光禄大夫谯周等人的劝说下，决定投降曹魏时，慷慨陈词，主张父子君臣背城一战，同死社稷，以见先帝。力谏刘禅拒降无果，悲愤不已，遂先杀妻子，后至昭烈庙痛哭自刎。","tc":"蜀漢后主劉禪第五子，昭烈帝劉備之孫。自幼聰明，英敏過人。景耀二年，被封為北地王。炎興元年，魏將鄧艾攻破綿竹關時，后主劉禪在光祿大夫譙周等人的勸說下，決定投降曹魏時，慷慨陳詞，主張父子君臣背城一戰，同死社稷，以見先帝。力諫劉禪拒降無果，悲憤不已，遂先殺妻子，后至昭烈廟痛哭自刎。","en":"The fifth son of Liu Shan, Latter Emperor of Shu Han, and a grandson of Emperor Zhaolie Liu Bei. Intelligent and brilliant from a young age, he was enfeoffed as Prince of Beidi in the second year of Jingyao. In the first year of Yanxing, when the Wei general Deng Ai breached Mianzhu Pass, Liu Shan, persuaded by Minister of Oration Qiao Zhou and others, decided to surrender to Cao Wei. Liu Chen passionately argued that father and son, ruler and subject should make a final stand at the walls and die with the state, so as to face the late emperor. When his impassioned pleas failed to sway Liu Shan, Liu Chen, overcome with grief and rage, first killed his own wife and children, then went to the Temple of Emperor Zhaolie, where he wept bitterly before taking his own life by the sword.","jp":"蜀漢の後主・劉禅の五男であり、昭烈帝・劉備の孫。幼少より聡明で、人並み外れて英敏であった。景耀二年に北地王に封じられる。炎興元年、魏将の鄧艾が綿竹関を攻め破り、後主・劉禅が光禄大夫の譙周らの説得を受けて曹魏への降伏を決めた際、慷慨陳詞して父子君臣が背水の陣で一戦を交え、社稷に殉じることで先帝に見えるべきだと主張した。劉禅に降伏を拒むよう力強く諫めたものの受け入れられず、悲憤やる方なく、まず妻子を殺害した後に昭烈廟に赴いて痛哭し、自刎して果てた。","kr":"촉한 후주 유선의 다섯째 아들이자 소열제 유비의 손자이다. 어려서부터 총명하고 영민함이 남달랐다. 경요 2년에 북지왕에 봉해졌다. 염흥 원년, 위나라 장수 등애가 면죽관을 함락하고 후주 유선이 광록대부 초주 등의 권유를 받아들여 조위에 항복하기로 하자, 강개히 진언하여 부자군신이 성을 등지고 일전을 벌여 사직과 함께 죽음으로써 선제를 뵈어야 한다고 주장했다. 유선에게 항복을 거부하도록 극력 간언했으나 무위에 그치자, 비분을 이기지 못하고 먼저 처자를 죽인 뒤 소열묘로 가 통곡하며 자결했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1013715","remark":"","surname":"刘","surnameTc":"劉","surnameEn":"Liu","surnameJp":"劉","surnameKr":"유","surnameOther":"","name":"谌","nameTc":"諶","nameEn":"Chen","nameJp":"諶","nameKr":"심","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","ic